(Non-IVANS Coverage Framework v1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Objective) Tj
T*
(Create a single daily operating view that combines IVANS and non-IVANS carrier activity so) Tj
T*
(policy status, renewals, and transaction visibility are reliable across all carriers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Why This Is Needed) Tj
T*
(Current reality: only ~25-35% of carriers reliably update through IVANS. If we rely only on) Tj
T*
(IVANS, we miss a large portion of policy movement and create false confidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Source-of-Truth Model) Tj
T*
(Use a multi-source hierarchy, not a single feed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Signal Tiers) Tj
T*
(1. Tier 1 \(High confidence\): Direct carrier confirmation \(download file, portal evidence,) Tj
T*
(issued policy docs\)) Tj
T*
(2. Tier 2 \(Medium confidence\): IVANS transaction confirmations) Tj
T*
(3. Tier 3 \(Low confidence\): CRM/manual notes without supporting artifact) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Record-Level Status Labels) Tj
T*
(- Verified via Carrier \(Tier 1\)) Tj
T*
(- Verified via IVANS \(Tier 2\)) Tj
T*
(- Pending Non-IVANS Confirmation) Tj
T*
(- Exception: Missing Update) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Daily Monitoring Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Feed A: IVANS Lane) Tj
T*
(- Failed transactions) Tj
T*
(- Canceled transactions) Tj
T*
(- Processed summary) Tj
T*
(- Timestamp + policy key mapping) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Feed B: Non-IVANS Lane) Tj
T*
(- Carrier portal download logs) Tj
T*
(- Carrier email docs \(decs, binders, cancellation notices\)) Tj
T*
(- Manual upload queue \(for broker/carrier docs\)) Tj
T*
(- QuoteRUSH/CD policy-change events where available) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Merge Logic) Tj
T*
(- Normalize by policy number + named insured + effective date) Tj
T*
(- Prefer Tier 1 over Tier 2 when conflicting) Tj
T*
(- Flag unresolved mismatches to exception queue) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
